1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,630
In the spring of 1945 American soldiers searched this field for the enemy and found a boy.

2
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:12,450
He had dug himself into the grass, under a groundsheet, his helmet full of straw.

3
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,010
Then he raised his hands.

4
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:18,620
Many boys his age had already served the guns as anti-aircraft auxiliaries.

5
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:24,220
In the last months of the war the Volkssturm called up everyone between 16 and 60.

6
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:26,930
They were taken prisoner by the thousands.

7
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:30,270
For them the war ended with their hands raised.
